# Line endings. The index has held LF for every text file all along; the
# working copy on Windows drifted to CRLF in about a hundred of them, and
# every commit printed a warning per file. LF everywhere, on every platform,
# so a checkout on the operator's machine and the public mirror agree byte
# for byte. Binary files are detected by git itself (text=auto).
* text=auto eol=lf
